  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0: Storage consolidation onto a single ColumnStorage<T> (sole-owner T[] + optional bool[] null mask; zero-copy slices; lazy zero-copy AsTensorView for unmanaged types); AutoDiff GradKernels span-kernel layer with inference-only fast paths (Gelu, GeluExact, LayerNorm, Linear transposed-weight cache); new ops AddBias, MatMulTransposedB, GeluExact, BatchedMultiHeadAttention (fused [B,L,D] batch attention); ADR-001 non-nullable AutoDiff domain enforced at runtime with zero-copy enter path; Optimizer StateDict/LoadStateDict and optimizer state in checkpoints; epoch-aware DataLoader.GetBatches; OrderBy/ThenBy computed sort keys; public AsTensorView (#107); NivaraEmbeddingGenerator in Nivara.Extensions; TextClassifierModel/TokenClassifierModel moved to samples; ArrowConversionOptions.UseZeroCopy removed. Core columnar engine unchanged: LINQ-like query engine, tensor-accelerated arithmetic and comparisons, lazy/eager/streaming/parallel execution strategies, explicit null mask semantics, schema-aware query planning with predicate pushdown and operation fusion, performance diagnostics, buffer pooling.",
